{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u6f02\u6d41\u3001\u306e\u3061\u3001\u5ea7\u7901",
    "steam_appid": 3842380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror experience set in a secluded house deep within the forest.<br>Uncover the truth of your past through quiet exploration and unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.<br>Interact with objects and collect fragments of memory as you unravel the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 15\u201330 minutes to complete.<br>Perfect for a short, immersive horror experience\u2014even for newcomers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>monochrome world</strong> enhances the eerie silence and surreal atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares. Fear comes from the <strong>slow, creeping dread</strong> that builds as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on <strong>psychological horror</strong>, using sound and space to instill a deep sense of discomfort.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Behind the Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 19-year-old student.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely self-taught in both programming and design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed in just two months with <strong>zero budget</strong>\u2014a true passion project and debut title.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Stream</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror experience set in a secluded house deep within the forest.<br>Uncover the truth of your past through quiet exploration and unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.<br>Interact with objects and collect fragments of memory as you unravel the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 15\u201330 minutes to complete.<br>Perfect for a short, immersive horror experience\u2014even for newcomers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>monochrome world</strong> enhances the eerie silence and surreal atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares. Fear comes from the <strong>slow, creeping dread</strong> that builds as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on <strong>psychological horror</strong>, using sound and space to instill a deep sense of discomfort.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Behind the Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 19-year-old student.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely self-taught in both programming and design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed in just two months with <strong>zero budget</strong>\u2014a true passion project and debut title.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Stream</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A first-person Japanese horror set in a secluded forest house. With no loud jump scares, it\u2019s ideal for beginners. Playtime: 15\u201330 minutes. Monochrome visuals create quiet, creeping tension. Developed in two months by a 19-year-old student, focusing on slow, unsettling exploration.",
